{"word":"ἀπαραίτητος","uri":"aparaitêtos","senses":[{"word":"ἀπαραίτητος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἀ·παραίτητος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ος,\nον</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> inexorable,\ninflexible, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">907</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span> ; <span class=\"aut\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"refch\">198, 5,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πρός τινα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Popl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">εἴς τινα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">DH.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">8, 25,</span> à l’égard de qqn ; <span class=\"grec\">περί τι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pyrrh.</span> <span class=\"refch\">16,</span> au sujet de qqe\nch. ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> qu’on ne peut\ndétourner, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> inévitable (châtiment,\nressentiment, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) <span class=\"aut\">T.\nLocr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">104</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ; <span class=\"aut\">Din.</span> <span class=\"refch\">93, 8 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 82, 9,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> irréparable,\nirrémédiable (faute, erreur, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>)\n<span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">30, 4,\n14 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">33, 8, 5</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> qu’on ne peut repousser\n(prière, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">M.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">950</span><span class=\"refpb\">f</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqe